## MCP Tools

| Tool | Args | Use |
|------|------|-----|
| `find_bulletins_for_period(start, end)` | year range | Filter by date |
| `search_corpus(keyword, context=20, max=50)` | keyword | Find bulletins |
| `read_bulletin(filename, lines=500)` | file, lines | Read bulletin |
| `extract_tables(filename, keyword, context=100)` | file, keyword | Extract tables |
| `extract_column_values(table, header)` | table, header | Get column |
| `calculate(expression)` | expression | Math eval |
| `linear_regression(x_values, y_values)` | two lists | OLS regression |
| `write_answer(answer)` | string | Final answer |

